2523: # ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- effort vocabularies
2524: #
2525: # -Effort and the purpose presets speak low|medium|high|xhigh. What an endpoint accepts
2526: # is DECLARED, never inferred (no host-wide or model-prefix guess): capability table
2527: # caps-v1 -
2528: #   the built-in openai provider (no user table, no OPENAI_BASE_URL)
2529: #       vocabulary openai for any model (Codex validates its own models)   low medium high xhigh
2530: #   hosts api.z.ai, open.bigmodel.cn
2531: #       vocabulary zai (mapping zai-v1) ONLY for the declared models below  low high max
2532: #       (exact, case-sensitive): medium -> high, xhigh -> max
2533: #   hosts token-plan-ams.xiaomimimo.com, token-plan-cn.xiaomimimo.com, api.xiaomimimo.com
2534: #       vocabulary mimo (mapping mimo-v1) ONLY for the declared models     none low medium
2535: #       below (exact): low, medium, high as is, xhigh -> high               high
2536: #   host ark.ap-southeast.bytepluses.com (BytePlus ModelArk Coding Plan)
2537: #       vocabulary ark (mapping ark-v1) ONLY for the declared models     low medium high
2538: #       below (exact): low, medium, high as is, xhigh -> high
2539: #   host api.kimi.ai (Kimi Code membership)
2540: #       vocabulary kimi (mapping kimi-v1) ONLY for the declared models   low high max
2541: #       below (exact): medium -> high, xhigh -> max
2542: #   host token-plan.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com (Alibaba Model Studio Token Plan)
2543: #       vocabulary alibaba (mapping alibaba-v1) ONLY for the declared    low medium high
2544: #       models below (exact), all four as is. The plan's `auto` router   xhigh
2545: #       is not declared: the endpoint picks its target model, so the accepted effort is unknown.
2546: #   engine:agy (the agy engine, any model)
2547: #       vocabulary model-tier (mapping model-tier): NOTHING is sent - the reasoning tier is
2548: #       part of the agy model id (gemini-3.8-flash-high); effort_sent null. -NativeEffort
2549: #       sends --effort <value> verbatim (agy checks it against the tier itself). The reply
2550: #       schema travels natively (--json-schema): SchemaTransport 'native'.
2551: # Anything else - an undeclared model on a known host, any model on another endpoint -
2552: # has no vocabulary: the run is refused unless -NativeEffort sends a value verbatim.
2553: # Codex's events do not report the effort the endpoint applied: effort_confirmed is null.
2554: $script:EffortCapsVersion = 'caps-v1'
2555: $script:EffortVocabularies = @{
