3433: # The provider's own error inside a failure text: an SSE payload `data:{"error":{...}}`
3434: # (MiMo sends its rejections that way) or a bare `{"error":{...}}` -> error.message and
3435: # error.code; otherwise the text itself. { Code; Message }.
3436: function ConvertFrom-ProviderErrorText {
