612: # The agy engine's read-only check (A17, widened in wave 18 - F09-1/F10-1): '' when nothing the
613: # review must not touch changed during the run, else the reason - the working tree (tracked
614: # or untracked files; the paths that changed), the collab directory (EVERY file under it,
615: # recursively: every task's stores and handoffs - outside the tree fingerprint; the run's own
616: # <task>/handoffs/NN-<prefix>-<slug>.* files and the .consult.* lock and recovery files
617: # excepted), the brief, an artifact. The check cannot tell who changed a file, so the text
618: # does not blame the reviewer (F09-3). Gitignored paths, submodules and files outside the
619: # repository stay unmonitored (README "Engines", F12). $CollabShown: the collab directory as
620: # shown in front of its paths ('.collab/' inside the repository, '' otherwise).
